<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Privacy Policy - <%= brand.name %><%= brand.suffix %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/labacinema.css">
  <%- include('../shared/head-meta') %>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../shared/nav', { brand: brand, query: '', active: '' }) %>

  <main class="nf-legal">
    <header class="nf-legal-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="nf-legal-meta">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="nf-legal-body">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong><%= brand.name %><%= brand.suffix %></strong>
        ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our
        service at labacinema.online.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        <strong><%= brand.name %><%= brand.suffix %></strong> is designed to work without
        an account. We do not require you to sign up, provide an email, or share personal
        details to watch movies. The only information we store is:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Anonymous visitor ID</strong> — a randomly generated identifier stored as
          a browser cookie. It lets us remember your watch history and watchlist on your
          device. It contains no personal information and is not linked to your identity.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Watch history &amp; watchlist</strong> — the movies you have played or
          saved, linked only to the anonymous visitor ID above.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Movie requests</strong> — if you choose to submit a request, we store the
          title, optional year, optional name, optional contact, and optional notes you
          provide. Providing contact is optional; you can submit without it.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Server logs</strong> — standard request logs kept for reliability and
          abuse prevention. These contain your IP address and request path, are retained
          for a short period, and are never shared with third parties for advertising.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we do NOT collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not require an account.</li>
        <li>We do not use advertising trackers or third-party analytics.</li>
        <li>We do not sell, rent, or share any user data.</li>
        <li>We do not store payment information.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use one essential cookie: <code>visitor_id</code>. It contains a randomly
        generated string and lets us show you your own watch history and watchlist on this
        device. It expires after one year and is only readable by our server. You can
        clear it at any time by clearing cookies in your browser — doing so will reset your
        history and watchlist on that device.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you log in to our upcoming paid service (LabaFlix), we may set additional
        session cookies necessary for authentication. Those will be disclosed separately
        when that service launches.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Because we do not require accounts and do not store personal data beyond what you
        choose to submit, exercising your rights is simple:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Clear your watch history and watchlist</strong> at any time from
          <a href="/history">/history</a> (Clear all history) or
          <a href="/watchlist">/watchlist</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Delete your cookie</strong> by clearing cookies in your browser — this
          permanently disconnects all history from your device.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Request removal of a movie request</strong> you submitted by contacting
          us at <a href="mailto:help@labacinema.online">help@labacinema.online</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        <%= brand.name %><%= brand.suffix %> is not directed to children under 13. We do
        not knowingly collect personal information from children. If a parent or guardian
        becomes aware that their child has provided personal information, please contact us
        and we will delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy to reflect changes to the service. When we do, we'll
        update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the
        service after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions or concerns? Reach us at
        <a href="mailto:help@labacinema.online">help@labacinema.online</a> or through
        <a href="/contact">our contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="nf-legal-footer">
      <a href="/" class="nf-legal-back">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('../shared/footer', { brand: brand }) %>
</body>
</html>
